{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐感受明显不如X细腻，删减了不少具体的音型、力度、节奏变化及其对应的情绪转折，部分感受变得概括。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为普通观众，Y的左右分栏更容易快速建立阅读习惯，左边的完整叙述让我知道人物正在经历什么，右边的短词帮助我迅速捕捉音乐和情绪，整体信息负担也更可控。尤其是人物为什么动摇、为什么怀念、为什么最终不回头，Y把中间的心理因果交代得更完整，前后转折也更连贯。X的优势是感受与音乐细节对应得更丰富、更具体，但大量感受短语即使分时出现，也容易让我来不及消化；它在细腻度上胜出，却没有把这些细节同样有效地转化成普通观众能及时接收到的信息。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e713014b-17df-469c-bd14-1ce0c6146540", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T232106376949Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:22:02.676966+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5443cbbfecf76c680c06b1deea9d65b1c5d0ac5b4264bfccf220444ee3848ba7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3